        targets of the WHO parent V88. Broader: targets subsume the accident-victim semantics; the
        activity suffix has no SNOMED CT representation and is lost. Moderate tier: crosswalk inherited
        from the WHO parent, not independently re-verified at the Swedish-extension level.
        """
}
